    "detailed_description": "you start your adventure with ComputerKeyboard with four basic keys. As you progress, the number of keys increases - the time needed to press the appropriate key also decreases. Giving a wrong answer reduces the number of keys. You can increase the range of available keys at any time.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nComputerKeyboard is a small program for learning to type without looking at the keyboard.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe applied method is focused on exercising all ten fingers in a natural way - to achieve the best results.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhen working with ComputerKeyboard, you focus on what is most important - you do not write words or sentences, but only - you stare at the computer screen with the keys displayed in the layout of the selected keyboard, and your fingers intuitively respond to a randomly selected key. Which forces you to position your hand correctly on the keyboard and makes your fingers learn to automatically identify the letter.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nthis program helps you learn to type without looking at the keyboard:<br />\r\nAustrian, English, American, Arabic, Azerbaijani, Belarusian, Bosnian, Bulgarian, Croatian, Montenegrin, Czech, Danish, Estonian, Finnish, French, Greek, Spanish, Kazakh, Lithuanian, Latvian, Moldovan, German, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese, Romanian, Russian, Serbian, Slovak, Slovenian, Swedish, Thai, Turkish, Ukrainian, Hungarian, Italian<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn addition, you can choose from the available languages - the language of messages displayed by the program",
    "about_the_game": "you start your adventure with ComputerKeyboard with four basic keys. As you progress, the number of keys increases - the time needed to press the appropriate key also decreases. Giving a wrong answer reduces the number of keys. You can increase the range of available keys at any time.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nComputerKeyboard is a small program for learning to type without looking at the keyboard.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe applied method is focused on exercising all ten fingers in a natural way - to achieve the best results.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhen working with ComputerKeyboard, you focus on what is most important - you do not write words or sentences, but only - you stare at the computer screen with the keys displayed in the layout of the selected keyboard, and your fingers intuitively respond to a randomly selected key. Which forces you to position your hand correctly on the keyboard and makes your fingers learn to automatically identify the letter.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nthis program helps you learn to type without looking at the keyboard:<br />\r\nAustrian, English, American, Arabic, Azerbaijani, Belarusian, Bosnian, Bulgarian, Croatian, Montenegrin, Czech, Danish, Estonian, Finnish, French, Greek, Spanish, Kazakh, Lithuanian, Latvian, Moldovan, German, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese, Romanian, Russian, Serbian, Slovak, Slovenian, Swedish, Thai, Turkish, Ukrainian, Hungarian, Italian<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn addition, you can choose from the available languages - the language of messages displayed by the program",
    "short_description": "ComputerKeyboard is a program for learning to type on the keyboard without looking. The available national keyboards will allow you to type on a native or foreign keyboard. As the keys progress, the number of keys increases and the response time decreases.",
